# Wave W17-O (Route 114): impact pine — a sturdy crater-field pine in warm grey-greens, tiered and full, its highlight lifted clear of the turf, on impact turf (ground baked in). Route 114’s own tree — warmer than Route 113’s ash-pale sweeppine and split from Route 115’s spray-fresh mistpine by register: dry stone-dust country grows a dustier pine.
